Package: farsr
Type: Package
Title: Read, Summarize and Map US Fatality Analysis Reporting System Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jefferson", "Ramirez", email = "jramirezgen@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions to read the yearly files of the US National Highway
    Traffic Safety Administration's Fatality Analysis Reporting System (FARS),
    count the fatal accidents per month and year, and map the accidents of a
    state. The package includes the FARS data for 2013 to 2015.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    graphics,
    magrittr,
    maps,
    readr,
    tibble,
    tidyr,
    utils
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
